source: tests/golden/harness.rs
---
  x `Not An Id` is not a build name
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-image/repo.kdl:5:5]
 4 | builds {
 5 |     "Not An Id"
   :     ^^^^^|^^^^^
   :          `-- not a build name
 6 |     broken-image
   `----
  help: a build name takes lowercase letters, digits and dashes, starting with
        a letter

  x `broken-image` lists no base
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-image/components/broken-image.kdl:1:1]
 1 | schema-version 1
   : ^
   : `-- nothing to build on
 2 | 
   `----
  help: list a base component, such as `base-image { fedora-bootc { version
        "44" } }`, or define one inline with `base "<image reference>"`

  x `name` takes no argument
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-image/components/broken-image.kdl:4:5]
 3 | component "/" {
 4 |     name "Broken Image"
   :     ^^|^
   :       `-- a path segment
 5 | }
   `----
  help: the os-release fields are options of the `os-release` component; list
        `os-release` in the image and set `name` in its block
